ng the effectiveness of Stagger by 15%, reducing all damage you take by 20%.\n    - \n- Summon Black Ox Statue\n    - 115315\n    - Summons a Black Ox Statue at the target location for 15 min, pulsing threat to all enemies within 20 yards.    You may cast Provoke on the statue to taunt all enemies near the statue.\n    - \n- Provoke\n    - 115546\n    - Taunts the target to attack you, and increases the threat you generate against them by 800% for 6 sec Causes them to move toward you at 50% increased speed.    This ability can be targeted on your Statue of the Black Ox, causing the same effect on all enemies within  10 yards of the statue.\n    - \n- Vivify\n    - 116670\n    - Causes a surge of invigorating mists, healing the target for 7,623.\n    - \n- Spear Hand Strike\n    - 116705\n    - Jabs the target in the throat, interrupting spellcasting and preventing any spell from that school of magic from being cast for 5 sec.\n    - \n- Tiger's Lust\n    - 116841\n    - Increases a friendly target's movement speed by 70% for 6 sec and removes all roots and snares.\n    - \n- Ring of Peace\n    - 116844\n    - Form a Ring of Peace at the target location for 5 sec. Enemies that enter will be ejected from the Ring.\n    - \n- Rushing Jade Wind\n    - 116847\n    - Summons a whirling tornado around you, causing 1,567 Physical damage over 5.0 sec to all enemies within 8 yards. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.\n    - \n- Mastery: Elusive Brawler\n    - 117906\n    - Each time you are hit by a melee attack, or hit with Blackout Kick, you gain stacking 34.5% increased Dodge chance until your next successful Dodge.    Also increases your attack power by 37.3%.\n    - \n- Crackling Jade Lightning\n    - 117952\n    - Channel Jade lightning, causing 373 Nature damage over 3.3 sec to the target and sometimes knocking back melee attackers.\n    - \n- Leg Sweep\n    - 119381\n    - Knocks down all enemies within 6 yards, stunning them for 3 sec.\n    - \n- Purifying Brew\n    - 119582\n    - Clears 60% of your |CFFffffffStaggered|R damage, or a minimum of 8% of your maximum health.\n    - \n- Transcendence: Transfer\n    - 119996\n    - Your body and spirit swap locations.\n    - \n- Keg Smash\n    - 121253\n    - Smash a keg of brew, dealing 3,731 Physical damage to your primary target and 2,487 Physical damage to all other enemies within 8 yds, and reducing their movement speed by 20% for 15 sec. Deals reduced damage beyond 5 targets.    Grants Shuffle for 5 sec and reduces the remaining cooldown on your Brews by 3 sec.\n    - \n- Gift of the Ox\n    - 124502\n    - When you take damage, you have a chance to summon a Healing Sphere.    |T606546:24|tHealing Sphere:  Summon a Healing Sphere visible only to you. Moving through this Healing Sphere heals you for 3,267.\n    - \n- Zen Flight\n    - 125883\n    - You fly through the air at a quick speed on a meditative cloud.\n    - \n- Zen Pilgrimage\n    - 126892\n    - Your spirit travels to your home temple, leaving your body behind.     Use Zen Pilgrimage again to return back to near your departure point.\n    - \n- Invoke Niuzao, the Black Ox\n    - 132578\n    - Summons an effigy of Niuzao, the Black Ox for 25 sec that attacks your primary target and Stomps when you cast Blackout Kick, damaging all nearby enemies.    While active, 40% of damage delayed by Stagger is instead Staggered by Niuzao, and Niuzao is healed for 100% of your purified Stagger.\n    - \n- Celestial Fortune\n    - 216519\n    - You have a chance equal to your critical strike chance to be healed for an additional 70% of the amount healed.\n    - \n- Detox\n    - 218164\n    - Removes all Poison and Disease effects from the target.\n    - \n- Brewmaster's Balance\n    - 245013\n    - Your Armor is increased by 55% and Stamina increased by 45%.\n    - \n- Expel Harm\n    - 322101\n    - Expel negative chi from your body, healing for 1,498 and dealing 10% of the amount healed as Nature damage to an enemy within 20 yards.    Draws in the positive chi of all your Healing Spheres to increase the healing of Expel Harm.\n    - \n- Touch of Death\n    - 322109\n    - You exploit the enemy target's weakest point, instantly dealing damage equal to 100% of your maximum health to creatures if they have less health than you. Deals damage equal to 35% of your maximum health against players and stronger creatures under 15% health.    Reduces delayed Stagger damage by 200% of damage dealt.\n    - \n- Exploding Keg\n    - 325153\n    - Hurls a flaming keg at the target location, dealing 5,072 Fire damage to nearby enemies, causing your attacks against them to deal 400 additional Fire damage, and causing their melee attacks to deal 100% reduced damage for the next 3 sec.    Resets the cooldown of Keg Smash.\n    - \n- Tiger Palm\n    - 418359\n    - Strike with the palm of your hand, dealing 2,038 Physical damage.    Reduces the remaining cooldown on your Brews by 1 sec.\n    - \n- Celestial Infusion\n    - 1241059\n    - A strong herbal brew that coalesces purified chi escaping your body into a celestial guard, absorbing 30% of incoming damage, up to 24,964 total.\n    - ",
