ll damage you take by 30%.\n    - \n- Provoke\n    - 115546\n    - Taunts the target to attack you, and increases the threat you generate against them by 800% for 6 sec.\n    - \n- Mastery: Combo Strikes\n    - 115636\n    - Your abilities deal 51.1% more damage when they are not a repeat of the previous ability.\n    - \n- Afterlife\n    - 116092\n    - When you kill an enemy, you summon a Healing Sphere, healing you for 969 when you walk through it.    When you kill an enemy with Blackout Kick, you have a 50% chance to summon a Chi Sphere, granting 1 Chi when you walk through it.\n    - \n- Disable\n    - 116095\n    - Reduces the target's movement speed by 50% for 15 sec, duration refreshed by your melee attacks. Targets already snared will be rooted for 8 sec instead.\n    - \n- Teachings of the Monastery\n    - 116645\n    - Tiger Palm causes your next Blackout Kick to strike an additional time dealing 505 Physical damage, stacking up to 8.    Blackout Kick has a 12% chance to reset the remaining cooldown on Rising Sun Kick.    \n    - \n- Vivify\n    - 116670\n    - Causes a surge of invigorating mists, healing the target for 6,746.\n    - \n- Spear Hand Strike\n    - 116705\n    - Jabs the target in the throat, interrupting spellcasting and preventing any spell from that school of magic from being cast for 5 sec.\n    - \n- Tiger's Lust\n    - 116841\n    - Increases a friendly target's movement speed by 70% for 6 sec and removes all roots and snares.\n    - \n- Ring of Peace\n    - 116844\n    - Form a Ring of Peace at the target location for 5 sec. Enemies that enter will be ejected from the Ring.\n    - \n- Crackling Jade Lightning\n    - 117952\n    - Channel Jade lightning, causing 142 Nature damage over 3.6 sec to the target and sometimes knocking back melee attackers.\n    - \n- Leg Sweep\n    - 119381\n    - Knocks down all enemies within 10 yards, stunning them for 3 sec.\n    - \n- Transcendence: Transfer\n    - 119996\n    - Your body and spirit swap locations.\n    - \n- Touch of Karma\n    - 122470\n    - Absorbs all damage taken for 10 sec, up to 50% of your maximum health, and redirects 70% of that amount to the enemy target as Nature damage over 6 sec.\n    - \n- Invoke Xuen, the White Tiger\n    - 123904\n    - Summons an effigy of Xuen, the White Tiger for 20 sec. Xuen attacks your primary target, and strikes 3 enemies within 10 yards every 0.9 sec with Tiger Lightning for 145 Nature damage.    Every 4 sec, Xuen strikes your enemies with Empowered Tiger Lightning dealing 4% of the damage you have dealt to those targets in the last 4 sec.\n    - \n- Zen Flight\n    - 125883\n    - You fly through the air at a quick speed on a meditative cloud.\n    - \n- Zen Pilgrimage\n    - 126892\n    - Your spirit travels to your home temple, leaving your body behind.     Use Zen Pilgrimage again to return back to near your departure point.\n    - \n- Combo Breaker\n    - 137384\n    - You have a 8% chance when you Tiger Palm to cause your next Blackout Kick to cost no Chi within 15 sec.\n    - \n- Touch of Death\n    - 322109\n    - You exploit the enemy target's weakest point, instantly dealing damage equal to 100% of your maximum health to creatures if they have less health than you. Deals damage equal to 35% of your maximum health against players and stronger creatures under 15% health.    Spawns 3 Chi Spheres, granting 1 Chi when you walk through them.\n    - \n- Strike of the Windlord\n    - 392983\n    - Strike with both fists at all enemies in front of you, dealing 9,616 Physical damage and reducing movement speed by 50% for 6 sec. Deals reduced damage to secondary targets.\n    - \n- Restore Balance\n    - 442719\n    - Damage increased by 5% while Xuen, the White Tiger is active.\n    - \n- Courage of the White Tiger\n    - 443087\n    - Tiger Palm has a chance to cause Xuen to claw your target for 1,788 Physical damage, healing a nearby ally for 25% of the damage done.    Invoke Xuen, the White Tiger guarantees your next cast activates this effect.\n    - \n- Strength of the Black Ox\n    - 443110\n    - After Xuen assists you, your next Blackout Kick refunds 2 stacks of Teachings of the Monastery and causes Niuzao to stomp at your target's location, dealing 1,019 damage to nearby enemies, reduced beyond 5 targets.\n    - \n- Heart of the Jade Serpent\n    - 443294\n    - Strike of the Windlord and Whirling Dragon Punch call upon Yu'lon to increase the cooldown recovery rate of Fists of Fury, Strike of the Windlord, Rising Sun Kick, and Whirling Dragon Punch by 75% for 6 sec.     The channel time of Fists of Fury is reduced by 50% while Yu'lon is active.\n    - \n- Inner Compass\n    - 443571\n    - You switch between alignments every 8 sec, increasing a corresponding secondary stat by 2%.    Crane Stance:  Haste    Tiger Stance:  Critical Strike    Ox Stance:  Versatility    Serpent Stance:   Mastery\n    - \n- Unity Within\n    - 443589\n    - Celestial Conduit can be recast once during its duration to call upon all of the August Celestials to assist you at 200% effectiveness.    Unity Within is automatically cast when Celestial Conduit ends if not used before expiration.\n    - \n- Momentum Boost\n    - 451294\n    - Fists of Fury's damage is increased by 100% of your haste and Fists of Fury does 10% more damage each time it deals damage, resetting when Fists of Fury ends.    Your auto attack speed is increased by 60% for 8 sec after Fists of Fury ends.\n    - \n- Flying Serpent Kick\n    - 1217413\n    - Soar forward through the air at high speed for 1.5 sec.     If used again while active, you will land, reducing the movement speed of enemies within 8 yds by 70% for 4 sec.\n    - \n- Single-Button Assistant\n    - 1229376\n    - Casts damaging abilities for use in combat, rotating through them based on priority.    The global cooldown of abilities used through the Single-Button Assistant is 25% longer.\n    - \n- Zenith\n    - 1249625\n    - Chi costs are reduced by 1 and Blackout Kick reduces the cooldown of affected abilities by an additional 1 sec for 15 sec.    Activating Zenith resets the remaining cooldown on Rising Sun Kick.\n    - ",
