ditional 12,005 Shadow damage over 6 sec. Heals you for 30% of damage dealt.    When reapplied to a target, all remaining damage is added to the new effect.\n    - \n- Mastery: Shadow Weaving\n    - 343690\n    - Your damage is increased by 6.8% for each of Vampiric Touch, Shadow Word: Pain, and Shadow Word: Madness on the target. During Voidform, all targets receive the maximum effect.\n    - \n- Tentacle Slam\n    - 1227280\n    - Summons a massive shadowy appendage to slam the ground, dealing 952 Shadow damage in front of you and 8 yds around your target.    Applies Vampiric Touch to up to 6 enemies, prioritizing ones without Vampiric Touch.    Generates 6 Insanity.\n    - ",
