ember back to life with 35% health and mana. Cannot be cast when in combat.  \n    - \n- Living Flame\n    - 361469\n    - Send a flickering flame towards your target, healing an ally for 698 or dealing 628 Fire damage to an enemy.\n    - \n- Azure Strike\n    - 362969\n    - Project intense energy onto 2 enemies, dealing 274 Spellfrost damage to them.\n    - \n- Mastery: Life-Binder\n    - 363510\n    - Healing done to allies is increased by 29.5% while their health percentage is lower than your own.\n    - \n- Obsidian Scales\n    - 363916\n    - Reinforce your scales, reducing damage taken by 30% . Lasts 12 sec.\n    - \n- Blessing of the Bronze\n    - 364342\n    - Weave the threads of time, reducing the cooldown of a major movement ability for all party and raid members by 15% for 1 |4hour:hrs;.\n    - \n- Echo\n    - 364343\n    - Wrap an ally with temporal energy, healing them for 216 and causing your next healing spell to cast an additional time on that ally at 70% of normal healing. Essence spells cannot be Echoed.\n    - \n- Naturalize\n    - 365585\n    - Cleanses harmful effects from the target, removing all Magic and Poison effects.\n    - \n- Reversion\n    - 366155\n    - Reverse an ally's injuries, healing them for 251 over 12 sec.    When Reversion critically heals, its duration is extended by 2 sec, up to a maximum of 12 sec.\n    - \n- Tail Swipe\n    - 368970\n    - Lash out with your tail, knocking enemies within 8 yds into the air.\n    - \n- Permeating Chill\n    - 381773\n    - Your damaging Blue spells reduce the target's movement speed by 50% for 3 sec.\n    - \n- Fury of the Aspects\n    - 390386\n    - Increases haste by 30% for all party and raid members for 40 sec.    Allies receiving this effect will become Exhausted and unable to benefit from Fury of the Aspects or similar effects again for 10 min.\n    - \n- Tempered Scales\n    - 396571\n    - Your dragon scales increase your armor by 75%.\n    - \n- Energizing Flame\n    - 400006\n