["Troll"] = "### Troll\n\n- Regeneration\n    - 20555\n    - Health regeneration rate increased by 10%. 10% of total Health regeneration may continue during combat.\n    - \n- Beast Slaying\n    - 20557\n    - Experience gains from killing Beasts increased by 20%.\n    - \n- Berserking\n    - 26297\n    - Increases your haste by 10% for 12 sec.\n    - \n- Da Voodoo Shuffle\n    - 58943\n    - Reduces the duration of all movement impairing effects by 20%. Trolls be flippin' out mon!\n    - ",
["Zandalari Troll"] = "### Zandalari Troll\n\n- Pterrordax Swoop\n    - 281954\n    - Reduces your falling speed for 2 min.\n    - \n- City of Gold\n    - 291619\n    - Increases gold earned from creatures by 2%.\n    - \n- Regeneratin'\n    - 291944\n    - Regenerate 50% of your maximum health over 6 sec, interrupted by direct damage. \n    - \n- Embrace of Pa'ku\n    - 292751\n    - Your abilities have a chance to grant you 4% Critical Strike for 12 sec.\n    - \n- Embrace of the Loa\n    - 292752\n    - Choose your Loa by making an offering at Loa Shrines around the world.     Each Loa offers unique powers. Guards in Dazar'alor will tell you where Shrines can be found. \n    - ",
["Undead"] = "### Undead\n\n- Touch of the Grave\n    - 5227\n    - Your attacks and damaging spells have a chance to drain the target, dealing 168 Shadow damage and healing you for the same amount. Additionally, you can breathe underwater indefinitely.\n    - \n- Will of the Forsaken\n    - 7744\n    - Removes any Charm, Fear and Sleep effect. \n    - \n- Cannibalize\n    - 20577\n    - When activated, regenerates 7% of total health and mana every 2 sec for 10 sec. Only works on Humanoid or Undead corpses within 5 yds. Any movement, action, or damage taken while Cannibalizing will cancel the effect.\n    - \n- Shadow Resistance\n    - 20579\n    - Reduces Shadow damage taken by 1%.\n    - ",
["Mechagnome"] = "### Mechagnome\n\n- Skeleton Pinkie\n    - 312890\n    - Allows opening of locked chests and doors that require a skill level of up to 80.\n    - \n- Mastercraft\n    - 312896\n    - You function as a personal Blacksmithing Anvil, Cooking Fire, and Mining Forge. In addition, your limbs include every profession tool.\n    - \n- Emergency Failsafe\n    - 312916\n    - When you fall below 20% health, heal for 15% of your maximum health. This effect cannot occur more than once every 2.5 min.\n    - \n- Combat Analysis\n    - 312923\n    - You gather and analyze combat data every 5 sec, increasing your primary stat by 1, stacking up to 10 times. The data decays while out of combat.\n    - \n- Hyper Organic Light Originator\n    - 312924\n    - Summon Organic Light duplicates to distract your foes for 15 sec.\n    - ",
["Vulpera"] = "### Vulpera\n\n- Fire Resistance\n    - 312198\n    - Reduces Fire damage taken by 1%.\n    - \n- Nose For Trouble\n    - 312215\n    - When you first take damage from an enemy, reduce that damage by 5% of your maximum health.\n    - \n- Make Camp\n    - 312370\n    - Make a camp at this location. Can only be used outdoors. \n    - \n- Return to Camp\n    - 312372\n    - Return to your camp. \n    - \n- Bag of Tricks\n    - 312411\n    - Pull your chosen trick from the bag and use it on target enemy or ally. Enemies take 165 damage and are snared by 80% for 4 sec, while allies are healed for 247 and move 20% faster for 4 sec.\n    - \n- Rummage Your Bag\n    - 312425\n    - Change the contents of your Bag of Tricks. Now where did you put that...?\n    - \n- Alpaca Saddlebags\n    - 317795\n    - Increases the size of your backpack by 8 slots.\n    - ",
["Kul Tiran"] = "### Kul Tiran\n\n- Haymaker\n    - 287712\n    - Wind up, then unleash your might upon your foe, dealing 405 Physical damage, stunning for 3 sec, and knocking them back substantially. \n    - \n- Rime of the Ancient Mariner\n    - 291417\n    - Reduces Frost and Nature damage taken by 1%.\n    - \n- Jack of All Trades\n    - 291442\n    - Skill in all professions increased by 2.\n    - \n- Child of the Sea\n    - 291622\n    - Hold your breath for 50% longer and swim 10% faster.\n    - \n- Brush It Off\n    - 291628\n    - Increases Versatility by 1%. When you take damage, heal for 2% of that amount over 4 sec.\n    - ",
["Draenei"] = "### Draenei\n\n- Heroic Presence\n    - 6562\n    - Increases your Strength, Agility, and Intellect by 1 (scales with level).\n    - \n- Gemcutting\n    - 28875\n    - Jewelcrafting skill increased by 5.\n    - \n- Shadow Resistance\n    - 59221\n    - Reduces Shadow damage taken by 1%.\n    - \n- Gift of the Naaru\n    - 121093\n    - Heals the target for 20% of the caster's total health over 5 sec.\n    - ",
