["Worgen"] = "### Worgen\n\n- Viciousness\n    - 68975\n    - Increases critical strike chance by 1%.\n    - \n- Aberration\n    - 68976\n    - Reduces Shadow and Nature damage taken by 1%.\n    - \n- Flayer\n    - 68978\n    - Increases your Skinning Skill by 5 and Deftness by 25%. Deftness allows you to skin more quickly.\n    - \n- Darkflight\n    - 68992\n    - Activates your true form, increasing current movement speed by an additional 40% for 10 sec.\n    - \n- Two Forms\n    - 68996\n    - Turn into your currently inactive form.\n    - \n- Running Wild\n    - 87840\n    - Drop to all fours to run as fast as a wild animal.\n    - \n- Calm the Wolf\n    - 406087\n    - Activate to control your worgen instincts and automatically assume human form when you leave combat.\n    - ",
