["Void Elf"] = "### Void Elf\n\n- Ethereal Connection\n    - 255667\n    - Reduces the cost of Transmogrification by 50%.\n    - \n- Chill of Night\n    - 255668\n    - Reduces Shadow damage taken by 1%.\n    - \n- Entropic Embrace\n    - 255669\n    - Your abilities have a chance to empower you with the essence of the Void, causing your damage and healing effects to deal an additional 5% as Shadowfrost for 12 sec.    \n    - \n- Preternatural Calm\n    - 255670\n    - Your spell casts are not delayed by taking damage. \n    - \n- Spatial Rift\n    - 256948\n    - Tear a rift in space. Reactivate this ability to teleport through the rift.      \n    - ",
