moning\n    - 698\n    - Begins a ritual to create a summoning portal, requiring the caster and 2 allies to complete. This portal can be used to summon party and raid members.\n    - \n- Curse of Weakness\n    - 702\n    - Increases the time between an enemy's attacks by 20% for 2 min.    Curses: A warlock can only have one Curse active per target.\n    - \n- Subjugate Demon\n    - 1098\n    - Subjugates the target demon up to level 81, forcing it to do your bidding for 10 min.\n    - \n- Summon Infernal\n    - 1122\n    - Summons an Infernal from the Twisting Nether, impacting for 301 Fire damage and stunning all enemies in the area for 2 sec.    The Infernal will serve you for 30 sec, dealing 276 damage to all nearby enemies every 1.5 sec and generating 1 Soul Shard Fragment every 1 sec.\n    - \n- Unending Breath\n    - 5697\n    - Allows an ally to breathe underwater and increases swim speed by 20% for 10 min.\n    - \n- Fear\n    - 5782\n    - Strikes fear in the enemy, disorienting for 20 sec. Damage may cancel the effect. Limit 1.\n    - \n- Create Healthstone\n    - 6201\n    - Creates a Healthstone that can be consumed to restore 30% health.\n    - \n- Conflagrate\n    - 17962\n    - Triggers an explosion on the target, dealing 2,103 Fire damage.    Reduces the cast time of your next Incinerate or Chaos Bolt by 30% for 10 sec.    Generates 5 Soul Shard Fragments.\n    - \n- Soulstone\n    - 20707\n    - Stores the soul of the target party or raid member, allowing resurrection upon death. Also castable to resurrect a dead target. Targets resurrect with 60% health and at least 20% mana.\n    - \n- Create Soulwell\n    - 29893\n    - Creates a Soulwell for 2 min. Party and raid members can use the Soulwell to acquire a Healthstone.\n    - \n- Shadowfury\n    - 30283\n    - Stuns all enemies within 8 yds for 3 sec.\n    - \n- Demonic Circle\n    - 48018\n    - Summons a Demonic Circle for 15 min. Cast Demonic Circle: Teleport to teleport to its location and remove all movement slowing effects.\n    - \n- Demonic Circle: Teleport\n    - 48020\n    - Teleports you to your Demonic Circle and removes all movement slowing effects.\n    - \n- Mastery: Chaotic Energies\n    - 77220\n    - Your spells deal 19.4% increased damage, plus a random amount of up to 19.4% additional increased damage.\n    - \n- Unending Resolve\n    - 104773\n    - Hardens your skin, reducing all damage you take by 25% and granting immunity to interrupt, silence, and pushback effects for 8 sec.\n    - \n- Dark Pact\n    - 108416\n    - Sacrifices 20% of your current health to shield you for 200% of the sacrificed health plus an additional 1,217 for 20 sec. Usable while suffering from control impairing effects.\n    - \n- Burning Rush\n    - 111400\n    - Increases your movement speed by 50%, but also damages you for 4% of your maximum health every 1 sec. Movement impairing effects may not reduce you below 100% of normal movement speed. Lasts until canceled.\n    - \n- Demonic Gateway\n    - 111771\n    - Creates a demonic gateway between two locations. Activating the gateway transports the user to the other gateway. Each player can use a Demonic Gateway only once per 90 sec.\n    - \n- Chaos Bolt\n    - 116858\n    - Unleashes a devastating blast of chaos, dealing a critical strike for 5,022 Chaos damage. Damage is further increased by your critical strike chance.\n    - \n- Shadow Bulwark\n    - 119898\n    - Temporarily increases current and maximum health by 30% for 20 sec.    Auto-Cast:  Use this ability when below 20% health.    (Right-Click to toggle)\n    - \n- Drain Life\n    - 234153\n    - Drains life from the target, causing 1,505 Shadow damage over 2.0 sec, and healing you for 700% of the damage done.\n    - \n- Soul Shards\n    - 246985\n    - Soul Shard Fragments are generated by many of your spells.    Soul Shards are consumed to cast your most powerful spells and summon demons to serve you.    While out of combat you regenerate up to 3 S